@1 = ~Ghostly Tail~
@2 = ~Ghostly Tail
(Evocation)

Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

A translucent, scaled tail uncoils behind the caster and lashes at nearby foes of its own accord. Once per round, the tail automatically strikes the nearest enemy in melee reach for 1d4 cold damage. The tail strikes a single target each round. Magic resistance does not protect against the tail.~

// Combat log
@3 = ~Struck by the Ghostly Tail~
